nejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"4.5\"></path>\n<path d=\"M50 38v36\" stroke=\"#DDE6E2\" stroke-width=\"4.5\"></path>\n</svg>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"coin coin--sol\" viewbox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n<circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" fill=\"url(#cg)\" r=\"46\" stroke=\"#1B3226\" stroke-width=\"3\"></circle>\n<g fill=\"#DDE6E2\">\n<path d=\"M32 36h40l-8 9H24z\"></path><path d=\"M32 46h40l-8 9H24z\"></path><path d=\"M32 56h40l-8 9H24z\"></path>\n</g>\n</svg>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"coin coin--eth\" viewbox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n<circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" fill=\"url(#cg)\" r=\"46\" stroke=\"#1B3226\" stroke-width=\"3\"></circle>\n<path d=\"M50 22 32 52l18 11 18-11z\" fill=\"#DDE6E2\"></path>\n<path d=\"M50 68 32 57l18 21 18-21z\" fill=\"#9AA8A2\"></path>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow hero__eyebrow\">Cripto · Monedas · Índices</div>\n<h1>\n<span class=\"hero__word\"><span class=\"chrome\" data-text=\"AMIX\">AMIX</span></span>\n<span class=\"hero__word hero__word--2\"><span class=\"emerald\" data-text=\"TEAM\">TEAM</span></span>\n</h1>\n<p class=\"hero__sub\">Equipo de trading, bot y análisis de sesiones — <b>en un solo lugar</b>.</p>\n<p class=\"hero__note\">Cada operación se publica antes de la entrada: par, dirección, stop, objetivos y monto de riesgo. Análisis: después del cierre, independientemente del resultado.</p>\n<div class=\"hero__cta\">\n\n<a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"https://t.me/AnastasiaAmixTeam\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Únete a Telegram</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn--ghost\" href=\"#products\">Qué hay dentro</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
